00:34:29,681 --> 00:34:33,681
This is how you get to the Bartos Theater.

768
00:34:33,681 --> 00:34:36,681
First thing you do is you get on these steps

769
00:34:36,681 --> 00:34:38,681
over at the Media Lab.

770
00:34:38,681 --> 00:34:42,681
Then you cross this large open space.

